          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_icml_2024_introduces_t_revsnn_tempor",
          "text": "This ICML 2024 paper introduces T-RevSNN, a Temporal Reversible architecture that turns off the temporal dynamics of most spiking neurons and makes the few remaining temporal connections reversible.",
