          "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_result_memory_1_inference_cost",
          "text": "The result is O(L) training memory and O(1) inference cost, with state-of-the-art accuracy among CNN-based SNNs on ImageNet and up to 8.6 times better memory efficiency, 2.0 times faster training, and 1.6 times lower inference energy.",
