          "chunk_id": "s02_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s02_c4_frustrating_part_current_methods_rel",
          "text": "The frustrating part is that current training methods can relieve one of these pressures but not the other at the same time, leaving SNNs stuck with a training memory and inference energy dilemma.",
          "expected_role": "method",
          "cue_keywords": [
            "frustrating",
